## Page Scaffold

Estrutura base para qualquer página nova:

```xml
<template>
  <Page actionBarHidden="true">
    <GridLayout rows="auto, *" class="bg-background">
      <StackLayout row="0" class="p-4 border-b border-border">
        <Label text="Título" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground" />
      </StackLayout>

      <ScrollView row="1">
        <StackLayout class="p-4">
          <!-- conteúdo -->
        </StackLayout>
      </ScrollView>
    </GridLayout>
  </Page>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
// lógica aqui
</script>
```

## Page com ListView

```xml
<template>
  <Page actionBarHidden="true">
    <GridLayout rows="auto, *, auto" class="bg-background">
      <StackLayout row="0" class="p-4 border-b border-border">
        <Label text="Lista" class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground" />
      </StackLayout>

      <ListView row="1" :items="items" separatorColor="transparent">
        <template #default="{ item }">
          <GridLayout columns="*, auto" class="list-item">
            <Label col="0" :text="item.name" class="text-base text-foreground" />
            <Label col="1" text="›" class="text-lg text-muted-foreground" />
          </GridLayout>
        </template>
      </ListView>

      <StackLayout row="2" class="footer-bar">
        <Button text="Adicionar" class="btn-primary" @tap="onAdd" />
      </StackLayout>
    </GridLayout>
  </Page>
</template>
```

## Regras para ListView

1. SEMPRE use `separatorColor="transparent"` — controle bordas via `list-item`
2. Evite `v-if` dentro de itens — use `visibility` ou `hidden` para performance
3. Para listas heterogêneas, use `itemTemplateSelector`
4. NUNCA aninhe `ScrollView` dentro de `ListView`

## Regras para disabled

NativeScript não tem `:disabled` CSS. Aplique manualmente:

```xml
<Button text="Salvar" class="btn-primary opacity-50" :isEnabled="false" />
<TextField hint="..." class="input-field opacity-50" :isEnabled="false" />
```
